Yes, open your "Event Viewer" (Start | Programs | Administrative Tools)
and select the "Log" menu.  Make sure Application is checked.  Select
"Clear All Events".  When asked to "Save", make your decision and when
asked "are you sure" select "yes".  You could also increase the size of
the log file by selecting the "Log" menu and choosing "Log Settings".

